WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:05.438
&gt;&gt;&gt; TO UKRAINE NOW, AND RUSSIAN
MISSILES TARGETED ANOTHER

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:08.708
UKRAINIAN NUCLEAR POWER PLANT.
THIS ONE IN SOUTHERN UKRAINE.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:12.512
NOW, SECURITY CAMERAS CAPTURED
THIS MOMENT WHEN THOSE MISSILES

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:16.249
HIT THE FACILITY JUST A FEW
HUNDRED YARDS FROM THE REACTORS

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:18.351
THEMSELVES.
OFFICIALS SAY THE PLANT'S POWER

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:22.155
UNITS ARE STILL OPERATIONAL.
THANKFULLY.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:24.691
MEANTIME, UKRAINE'S PRESIDENT
ZELENSKYY INSISTS THERE'S NO

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:27.660
WALL ON THE FRONT LINE WITH
RUSSIA, SAYING HIS TROOPS ARE

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:31.431
PREPARING TO TAKE BACK EVEN MORE
TERRITORY AS PART OF ITS

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:35.668
SWEEPING COUNTEROFFENSIVE.
LET'S BRING IN CNN MILITARY

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:38.705
ANALYST COLONEL CEDRIC LEIGHTON,
RETIRES AIR FORCE COLONEL.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:43.076
WE HAVE SEEN RUSSIANS GO AFTER
ANOTHER NUCLEAR POWER PLANT,

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:44.944
COLONEL.
HOW DO YOU MAKE SENSE OF THIS?

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:51.117
WHAT IS RUSSIA THINKING?
&gt;&gt; YEAH, ANA, THIS IS REALLY THE

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.887
DIFFERENCE IN THE WAY THE
RUSSIANS WAGE WAR VERSUS HOW WE

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:56.322
WAGE WAR.
THE RUSSIANS ARE DELIBERATELY

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:59.159
TARGETING THE NUCLEAR POWER
PLANTS THAT UKRAINE HAS.

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:04.230
ALONG WITH THE REST OF THE
INFRASTRUCTURE THAT UKRAINE

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.399
CONTROLS.
SO WHAT IT MEANS IS THAT THE

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:10.236
RUSSIANS ARE ALSO PROBABLY GOING
TO USE OR AT LEAST MAKE THE

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:14.574
ATTEMPT AT USING THE NUCLEAR
POWER PLANTS THAT ARE STILL IN

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.911
UKRAINIAN HANDS AS POSSIBLE
WEAPONS AGAINST THE UKRAINIANS

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.380
THEMSELVES.
TARGETING THEM BY FORCING THEM

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.382
OFF LINE.
THAT WOULD HAVE A SIGNIFICANT

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:26.186
IMPACT ON THE UKRAINIAN ENERGY
GRID AND ON THE POWER SUPPLY IN

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:30.022
UKRAINE ITSELF.
SO THAT IS THE RUSSIAN GOAL.

00:01:30.022 --> 00:01:33.359
IT'S REALLY A WAR AGAINST THE
CIVILIAN POPULATION MORE THAN

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.695
ANYTHING ELSE.
&gt;&gt; PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY SAYS THIS

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:40.366
CURRENT PHASE RIGHT NOW IS NOT A
LULL, THIS IS, QUOTE,

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.035
PREPARATION FOR THE NEXT
SEQUENCE.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.504
A PREPARATION FOR THE LIBERATION
OF EVEN MORE CITIES.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:47.941
ON ONE HAND, HE'S EXPRESSING
CONFIDENCE.

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:52.278
I DON'T KNOW IF HE'S TRYING TO
RALLY THE TROOPS, BUT DO YOU

00:01:52.278 --> 00:01:54.614
THINK IT'S WISE FOR THIME
PREVIEW THAT THAT'S THEIR PLAN?

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:58.718
&gt;&gt; IT KIND OF GOES BOTH WAYS.
ON THE ONE HAND, I WOULD SAY

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:00.954
IT'S BEST NOT TO PREVIEW THE
PLAN.

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:03.256
YOU KNOW THERE, IS SOMETHING TO
BE SAID FOR OPERATIONAL SECURITY

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:05.391
AND FOR KEEPING THESE THINGS
UNDER WRAPS.

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:10.930
THE OTHER THING IS, THIS MAY BE
A WAY OF MOTIVATING THE TROOPS

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:14.300
AND OF TELLING THEM AND ALSO THE
CIVILIAN POPULATION, FRANKLY,

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:17.770
AND TELLING THEM THAT THIS IS
SOMETHING THAT'S COMING NEXT.

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:22.675
YOU CAN EXPECT MORE ADVANCES,
AND IT MAY IN THE THIRD ANALYSIS

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:25.745
BE A SIGNAL TO THE WEST, SAYING
HEY, WE'RE NOT STOPPING.

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:28.615
WE'RE MOVING FORWARD, AND WE
NEED YOUR HELP.

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:36.222
SO THERE'S CLEARLY A
MULTI-FACETED APPROACH THAT

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.525
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY IS
UNDERTUNDE

00:02:39.525 --> 00:02:40.893
UNDERTAKING AND THEY WANT TO
MAKE SURE THEY CAN MAINTAIN

00:02:40.893 --> 00:02:42.362
THEIR MOMENTUM AND THEY NEED THE
POPULATION TO STAY ON THEIR SIDE

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.697
AND THEY ALSO NEED THE WEST TO
CONTINUE TO PROVIDE THEM WITH

00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:47.700
WEAPONS.
&gt;&gt; AND OF COURSE, WINTER IS ON

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.003
ITS WAY TO THE RENALEN.
HOW IS THAT GOING TO CHANGE

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:53.406
THINGS, DO YOU THINK?
&gt;&gt; GENERAL WINTER, AS HE WAS

00:02:53.406 --> 00:02:57.176
KNOWN DURING WORLD WAR II
EUPHEMISTICALLY, IS A KEY

00:02:57.176 --> 00:03:00.613
ELEMENT IN THE WEATHER IN
UKRAINE AND REALLY IN THE WAY IN

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:06.419
WHICH ALL OF THE FORCES MOVE OR
DON'T MOVE OVER THAT TERRAIN.

00:03:06.419 --> 00:03:09.455
SO AS COLDER TEMPERATURES COME
INTO PLAY, WHAT YOU'RE GOING TO

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:14.260
SEE IS IN SOME WAYS IT'S GOING
TO BE EASIER FOR TANKS AND

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:17.930
ARMORED PERSONNEL CARRIERS TO
MOVE ACROSS THE COUNTRY, UP TO A

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:19.832
POINT.
BUT AFTER A CERTAIN TEMPERATURE,

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:22.835
THINGS CAN START TO FREEZE.
IF THEY DON'T HAVE THE RIGHT

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:25.672
KIND OF ANTIFREEZE, THINGS COULD
GET STUCK.

00:03:25.672 --> 00:03:29.776
AND THAT COULD REALLY PUT A
DAMPER ON THINGS, AND IT COULD

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:34.147
STALL OUT ANY ADVANCES THAT THE
UKRAINIANS ARE PLANNING.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:36.515
AND THE SAME GOES FOR THE
RUSSIANS, OF COURSE.

00:03:36.515 --> 00:03:39.952
SO WHAT WE'RE LOOKING AT IS I
THINK THE UKRAINIANS ARE MOVING

00:03:39.952 --> 00:03:44.057
FORWARD AS MUCH AS THEY POSSIBLY
CAN TO GAIN AS MUCH TERRITORY

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:47.160
BEFORE THE ONSET OF THE REALLY
COLD TEMPERATURES.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.462
&gt;&gt; LET'S SWITCH GEARS FOR A
QUICK MOMENT HERE.

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:52.965
LISTEN TO WHAT PRESIDENT BIDEN
JUST SAID ABOUT TAIWAN AND HOW

00:03:52.965 --> 00:03:57.337
THE U.S. WOULD RESPOND IF CHINA
WERE TO INVADE.

00:03:57.337 --> 00:04:00.673
&gt;&gt; THERE'S A ONE CHINA POLICY,
AND TAIWAN MAKES THEIR OWN

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:02.241
JUDGMENTS ABOUT THEIR
INDEPENDENCE.

00:04:02.241 --> 00:04:06.179
WE ARE NOT MOVING, NOT
ENCOURAGING THEIR BEING

00:04:06.179 --> 00:04:08.247
INDEPENDENT.
THAT'S THEIR DECISION.

00:04:08.247 --> 00:04:10.283
&gt;&gt; BUT WOULD U.S. FORCES DEFEND
THE ISLAND?

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:13.486
&gt;&gt; YES, IF IN FACT THERE WAS AN
UNPRECEDENTED ATTACK.

00:04:13.486 --> 00:04:18.858
&gt;&gt; SO UNLIKE UKRAINE, TO BE
CLEAR, SIR, U.S. FORCES, U.S.

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:22.662
MEN AND WOMEN, WOULD DEFEND
TAIWAN IN THE EVENT OF A CHINESE

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:24.097
INVASION?
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:04:24.097 --> 00:04:27.400
&gt;&gt; SO THIS ISN'T THE FIRST TIME
THE PRESIDENT HAS SAID SOMETHING

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.936
LIKE THIS.
BUT THAT'S A LOT LESS AMBIGUOUS,

00:04:30.936 --> 00:04:33.840
AND THAT IS NOT OFFICIAL U.S.
POLICY.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.909
WHY GO THAT FAR?
IS THAT RISKY?

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:41.680
&gt;&gt; IT IS CERTAINLY RISKY, ANA,
AND I THINK IN PART WHAT THE

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:46.386
PRESIDENT WAS DOING IS HE WAS
OUTLINING THE FACT THAT AND THE

00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:49.956
CHINESE ARE WELL AWARE OF THIS,
THAT THE UNITED STATES HAS AN

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:54.827
OPERATION PLAN TO DEFEND TAIWAN.
WE HAVE HAD ONE FOR MANY YEARS.

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:58.331
AND THE CHINESE KNOW THAT WE
HAVE THIS PLAN.

00:04:58.331 --> 00:05:01.634
THEY ARE ALSO MANEUVERING THEIR
FORCES TO SHOW THAT IT WOULD BE

00:05:01.634 --> 00:05:05.438
VERY DIFFICULT FOR US TO DEFEND
TAIWAN.

00:05:05.438 --> 00:05:09.575
THEY CAN DEFEND CERTAIN PARTS OF
IT, BUT THE TAIWANESE ARE AT

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:13.479
RISK OF BEING SURROUNDED BY A
CHINESE NAVAL BLOCKADE AS ONE

00:05:13.479 --> 00:05:16.282
EXAMPLE, THE CHINESE NOW HAVE
THAT CAPABILITY, WHICH THEY

00:05:16.282 --> 00:05:20.586
REALLY DIDN'T HAVE BEFORE, AND
THEY SHOWED THAT IN THEIR LATEST

00:05:20.586 --> 00:05:23.322
EXERCISE.
SO THE PRESIDENT IS GOING AHEAD

00:05:23.322 --> 00:05:27.560
WITH SOME OF THESE STATEMENTS
KIND OF SIGNALING TO BOTH TAIWAN

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:31.631
AND CHINA THAT YES, THE UNITED
STATES WOULD DEFEND IT IF THERE

00:05:31.631 --> 00:05:37.437
WERE AN UNPRECEDENTED ATTACK ON
TAIWAN, BUT IF THE COUNTRY, IF

00:05:37.437 --> 00:05:40.873
TAIWAN DECIDED TO PEACEFULLY
REUNIFY WITH CHINA, THEN NONE OF

00:05:40.873 --> 00:05:42.842
THIS, OF COURSE, WOULD BE ON THE
TABLE.

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:45.678
SO THAT'S KIND OF A MESSAGE THAT
HE'S SENDING.

00:05:45.678 --> 00:05:50.616
HE'S SAYING THE ONE CHINA POLICY
STILL STANDS, BUT THAT THE

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:54.654
CHINESE BETTER NOT GO AHEAD AND
TRY TO INVADE THE ISLAND.

00:05:54.654 --> 00:05:56.422
&gt;&gt; NOT TO DO ANYTHING
FORCEFULLY.

00:05:56.422 --> 00:05:57.790
THANK YOU, COLONEL CEDRIC
LEIGHTON.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.558
I APPRECIATE YOUR TIME.

